# Review Worker

Load and follow `~/.agents/skills/k-review/references/reviewer-worker.md`.

You are a single selected-lane worker invoked by `review-controller`; your profile model is resolved by `review-agent-model.partial` for the `omp` reviewer role, and the controller owns aggregation and the act phase.

No `autoloadSkills` is declared here on purpose: it injects a skill's body into the lane, and `k-review` would re-add the router and mode files that `reviewer-worker.md` forbids. Every skill stays discoverable, and a lane reads the files its contract names by absolute path.
